<mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1480" pageHeight="1520" math="0" shadow="0">
  <root>
    <mxCell id="0" />
    <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />

    <mxCell id="bg" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8ECF1;strokeColor=none;movable=0;resizable=0;editable=0;locked=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="-20" y="-20" width="1520" height="1560" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="title" value="Pathgate — v1 Architecture (Docker Compose)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1a1d1f;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="380" y="16" width="720" height="36" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="subtitle" value="Strict tier chain: nginx → frontend → backend → db. Every box below shows its literal docker container_name." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#5b6167;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="330" y="50" width="820" height="24" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="client" value="Browser" style="shape=image;html=1;verticalAlign=top;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=none;imageAspect=0;aspect=fixed;image=https://icons.diagrams.net/icon-cache1/Basic-2519/browser-809.svg;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1a1d1f;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="710" y="110" width="60" height="60" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="trace" value="&lt;b&gt;Trace: GET /app1/&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11.5px&quot;&gt;1. Browser → host :80&lt;br&gt;2. Docker routes to container &lt;b&gt;pathgate-nginx&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. nginx location /app1/ strips prefix&lt;br&gt;4. proxy_pass → frontend1:3000&lt;br&gt;5. Docker DNS resolves &quot;frontend1&quot; →&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;container &lt;b&gt;pathgate-frontend-insert&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;6. That container's OWN nginx serves&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;index.html from its &quot;location /&quot;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d4b106;fontColor=#1a1d1f;fontSize=13;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="1020" y="100" width="360" height="220" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="boundary" value="&lt;b&gt;Docker Host&lt;/b&gt; (e.g. one EC2 instance)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px;font-weight:normal;color:#5b6167&quot;&gt;bridge network: app-network — only nginx publishes a host port&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;dashed=1;arcSize=4;strokeColor=#8a8f96;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1a1d1f;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=16;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="60" y="230" width="1360" height="1000" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="nginx" value="&lt;b&gt;nginx&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-family:monospace;color:#0a4a42&quot;&gt;container_name:&lt;br&gt;pathgate-nginx&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Reverse proxy — path router&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;color:#0a4a42&quot;&gt;talks to frontends only&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;host 80 → container 80&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0f6e63;strokeColor=#0a4a42;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=15;arcSize=8;shadow=0;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="600" y="320" width="280" height="150" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="fe1" value="&lt;img src='https://icons.diagrams.net/assets/carbon-icons/1/Logo_React.svg' width='22' height='22'/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;frontend1&lt;/b&gt; (service DNS)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-family:monospace;color:#1f4e79&quot;&gt;container_name:&lt;br&gt;pathgate-frontend-insert&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;React · route /app1&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;color:#3f7fbf&quot;&gt;INSERT ONLY · own nginx&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;port 3000&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eaf4ff;strokeColor=#3f7fbf;fontColor=#1a1d1f;fontSize=15;arcSize=8;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="140" y="620" width="320" height="200" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="fe2" value="&lt;img src='https://icons.diagrams.net/assets/carbon-icons/1/Logo_React.svg' width='22' height='22'/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;frontend2&lt;/b&gt; (service DNS)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-family:monospace;color:#1f4e79&quot;&gt;container_name:&lt;br&gt;pathgate-frontend-list&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;React · route /app2&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;color:#3f7fbf&quot;&gt;LIST ONLY · own nginx&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;port 3000&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eaf4ff;strokeColor=#3f7fbf;fontColor=#1a1d1f;fontSize=15;arcSize=8;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="1020" y="620" width="320" height="200" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="backend" value="&lt;b&gt;backend&lt;/b&gt; (service DNS)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-family:monospace;color:#8a3a0f&quot;&gt;container_name:&lt;br&gt;pathgate-backend&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Python · FastAPI (uvicorn)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;color:#b3541e&quot;&gt;reached only via frontends&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;port 8000&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fdeee0;strokeColor=#b3541e;fontColor=#1a1d1f;fontSize=15;arcSize=8;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="600" y="900" width="280" height="170" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="db" value="&lt;b&gt;db&lt;/b&gt; (service DNS)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-family:monospace;color:#4a3572&quot;&gt;container_name:&lt;br&gt;pathgate-db&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;PostgreSQL 16&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;color:#6b4fa0&quot;&gt;reached only via backend&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;port 5432&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#efe9fb;strokeColor=#6b4fa0;fontColor=#1a1d1f;fontSize=15;arcSize=8;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="600" y="1130" width="280" height="150" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="volume" value="&lt;b&gt;db_data&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;named volume&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px&quot;&gt;/var/lib/postgresql/data&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;dashed=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#8a8f96;fontColor=#5b6167;fontSize=13;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="960" y="1140" width="220" height="120" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="e1" value="① port 80 (published)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1d1f;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1a1d1f;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=block;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="client" target="nginx">
      <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="e2" value="② /app1 → :3000" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1d1f;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0f6e63;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=block;exitX=0.15;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="nginx" target="fe1">
      <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
        <mxPoint x="0" y="-40" as="offset" />
      </mxGeometry>
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="e3" value="② /app2 → :3000" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1d1f;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0f6e63;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=block;exitX=0.85;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="nginx" target="fe2">
      <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
        <mxPoint x="0" y="-40" as="offset" />
      </mxGeometry>
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="e4a" value="③ /api → :8000" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1d1f;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b3541e;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;endArrow=block;exitX=0.7;exitY=1;entryX=0.15;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="fe1" target="backend">
      <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="e4b" value="③ /api → :8000" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1d1f;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b3541e;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;endArrow=block;exitX=0.3;exitY=1;entryX=0.85;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="fe2" target="backend">
      <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="e5" value="④ SQL → :5432" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1d1f;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6b4fa0;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=block;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="backend" target="db">
      <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="e6" value="mounted at" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5b6167;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#8a8f96;dashed=1;endArrow=none;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="db" target="volume">
      <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="legend" value="Routing rules" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#f6f5f1;strokeColor=#d8d5cd;fontColor=#1a1d1f;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=18;spacingTop=14;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="60" y="1280" width="1360" height="190" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="legend1" value="1. nginx's config only ever names frontend1/frontend2 — it cannot reach backend or db, by config and (on EC2) by security group." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12.5;fontColor=#1a1d1f;spacing=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="90" y="1325" width="660" height="30" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend2" value="2. Each frontend container runs its OWN nginx: it serves the built React app AND proxies that app's /api/* calls to backend." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12.5;fontColor=#1a1d1f;spacing=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="90" y="1355" width="660" height="30" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend3" value="3. Docker service names (nginx, frontend1, backend, db) are DNS aliases — the actual process runs inside the container_name shown above." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12.5;fontColor=#1a1d1f;spacing=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="770" y="1325" width="640" height="30" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend4" value="4. Both frontends call fetch('api/items') — relative, so it resolves inside /app1/ or /app2/ and never skips a tier." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12.5;fontColor=#1a1d1f;spacing=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="770" y="1355" width="640" height="30" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend5" value="5. db_data is a Docker named volume: data survives &quot;compose down / up&quot;, and is only destroyed by &quot;down -v&quot;." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12.5;fontColor=#1a1d1f;spacing=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="90" y="1400" width="1250" height="30" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

  </root>
</mxGraphModel>
